  "content": "<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n<img width=100% src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/fALx4O2Q/images/f832ada384bcc9394a57aba17e8204a03e5ccd7c.jpeg\">\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-8c2454?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-8c2454?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo_Forge-8c2454?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=8c2b24\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>「裝飾配件」添加了時尚的裝飾性配件，微妙地增強遊戲體驗。多種視覺裝飾讓您個性化您的角色，同時避免將裝飾品變成必備裝備。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769705258/header/features.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dnGufYY.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>時尚裝飾配件</h1>\n            <p>「裝飾配件」專注於視覺表達。從帽子、配件到背掛物品，每一件設計都是為了襯托您的角色，而非取代護甲或裝備。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>局部染色</h1>\n            <p>每個裝飾配件都可以染色，但不一定完全染色。每件物品定義了自己的可染色區域：例如高頂禮帽可以完全重新上色，而海盜帽只允許更改羽毛顏色。這既保持了設計的可識別性，又提供了自訂選項。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/fALx4O2Q/images/47ed9532f7ae76c6c199cb1ac0a906f4ce53109a.png\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/fALx4O2Q/images/535e5c886c2a6813c378e68728206ed59601d635.png\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>兼具美觀與效益</h1>\n            <p>裝飾配件並非純粹裝飾。每件物品都提供一個小型、情境性的增益，讓您感到回報，同時不會掩蓋核心遊戲進程。例如，背掛武士刀可在裝備時提供+5%傷害。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>可選飾品模組支援</h1>\n            <p>內建與 Curios API 和 Trinkets API 的兼容性。當安裝任一模組時，特定裝飾配件會自動成為飾品，並可裝備在專用欄位。若未安裝這些模組，所有物品仍能正常運作。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/fALx4O2Q/images/cfb51a909b02c43bed7a3a5ff2cab95593f6331d.png\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/fALx4O2Q/images/d1ca703ebd211fcbd7cbc14f20145eef29b2232e.png\" width=\"100%\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>可配置屬性</h1>\n            <p>裝飾配件提供的所有增益都可以透過設定檔調整。您可以微調數值、為模組包重新平衡物品，或完全停用特定效果，同時保留裝飾外觀。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></center>\n\n<br>\n\n## 遊戲內設定\n在 Minecraft 1.20.1 中，使用 [Forge Config Screens](https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-screens) 或 [Configured](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured) 時，可透過遊戲內設定選單進行配置。若未安裝這些模組，所有設定仍可透過設定檔（<i>config/obscuria/accents-common.toml</i>）調整。從 Minecraft 1.21.1 開始，遊戲內設定畫面將預設可用，無需額外依賴。\n\n## 裝飾護甲與外觀模組\n「裝飾配件」與僅改變外觀的護甲模組（如 [Cosmetic Armor Reworked](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked)）相容良好。您可以在隱藏或單獨設定護甲外觀的同時，仍佩戴裝飾配件以獲得視覺效果。\n\n## 歡迎建議\n許多裝飾配件都是基於玩家的建議而添加。如果您有任何想法——無論是風格、主題或小型增益——都非常有可能被考慮。\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769705260/header/more-from-obscuria.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/aquamirae.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/obscure-tooltips\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/obscure-tooltips.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pillager-caravans\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/pillager-caravans.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-elixirum\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/ars-elixirum.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/accents\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/blank.png\" width=\"45%\" />\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/patreon.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/discord.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>",
